      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The desert manticore Strikes an Off-Guard creature with its stinger. The attack injects venom deeply, dealing an additional 4d8 poison damage and giving the target a –2 circumstance penalty to their initial save against the poison.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
