    {
      "name": "Venomous Flight",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The desert manticore Flies twice, dripping venom from its stinger. It chooses a creature it flew directly above during the flight, which is exposed to manticore venom. The desert manticore cannot fly further than 60 feet above the target or the venom becomes too dispersed in fall to take effect.</p>",
